{
  "name": "01_scene",
  "description": "迁移自 tests/integration/scene_tools_test.cpp（SceneToolsTest，12 用例）。before_all 用 editor_new_scene 建干净根 Root。无法完全覆盖的语义：1) 用例1 '省略 parent_path 建根'：before_all 已建根，省略 parent_path 属双根错误（由步骤 create_second_root_fails 覆盖），本用例改用明确根路径 parent_path=Root 验证建节点与相对 path 断言；2) 用例4 '删除后树中消失'：scene_node_delete 为 queue_free 异步释放，JSON 框架无 sleep 机制（gtest 靠 sleep 500ms），改为断言返回 deleted 与 undo 存在；3) 用例8 children 数组内容精确断言：field_checks 不支持数组索引，退化为 children 非空 + 根字段精确断言；4) 用例10 的 '拒绝后场景仍在' 断言拆为独立步骤 scene_unchanged_after_refuse。",
  "headless": true,
  "pipeline": {
    "on_failure": "fail_fast",
    "before_all": [
      {
        "id": "before_new_scene",
        "tool": "editor_new_scene",
        "args": { "name": "Root" }
      }
    ],
    "stages": [
      {
        "id": "scene_create",
        "steps": [
          {
            "id": "create_node_via_explicit_root_path",
            "tool": "scene_node_create",
            "args": { "name": "NodeA", "type": "Node", "parent_path": "Root" },
            "expect": {
              "has_keys": ["result"],
              "field_checks": [
                { "key": "result.path", "value": "NodeA" },
                { "key": "result.undo", "not_empty": true }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "create_with_defaults",
            "tool": "scene_node_create",
            "args": { "parent_path": "Root" },
            "expect": {
              "field_checks": [
                { "key": "result.path", "value": "NewNode" }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "create_label_child",
            "tool": "scene_node_create",
            "args": { "name": "Lbl", "type": "Label", "parent_path": "Root" },
            "expect": {
              "field_checks": [
                { "key": "result.path", "value": "Lbl" }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "create_sprite2d_child",
            "tool": "scene_node_create",
            "args": { "name": "Spr", "type": "Sprite2D", "parent_path": "Root" },
            "expect": {
              "field_checks": [
                { "key": "result.path", "value": "Spr" }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "create_invalid_type",
            "tool": "scene_node_create",
            "args": { "name": "Bad", "type": "NoSuchNodeType123" },
            "expect": {
              "field_checks": [
                { "key": "error", "value": "NoSuchNodeType123 is not a Node subclass" }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "create_second_root_fails",
            "tool": "scene_node_create",
            "args": { "name": "SecondRoot" },
            "expect": {
              "field_checks": [
                { "key": "error", "value": "scene already has a root, use parent_path to add children" }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_delete",
        "steps": [
          {
            "id": "create_doomed_node",
            "tool": "scene_node_create",
            "args": { "name": "Doomed", "type": "Node", "parent_path": "Root" },
            "expect": {
              "field_checks": [
                { "key": "result.path", "value": "Doomed" }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "delete_child_ok",
            "tool": "scene_node_delete",
            "args": { "path": "Doomed" },
            "expect": {
              "has_keys": ["undo"],
              "field_checks": [
                { "key": "result", "value": "deleted" }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "delete_missing_node",
            "tool": "scene_node_delete",
            "args": { "path": "NoSuchNode" },
            "expect": {
              "field_checks": [
                { "key": "error", "value": "node not found: NoSuchNode — 当前场景根为 \"Root\"；合法路径写法：Root/子路径、/root/Root/子路径、子路径" }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "delete_root_forbidden",
            "tool": "scene_node_delete",
            "args": { "path": "Root" },
            "expect": {
              "field_checks": [
                { "key": "error", "value": "cannot delete the scene root node — use editor_close_scene to close the scene, then editor_new_scene" }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_inspect",
        "steps": [
          {
            "id": "get_tree_with_properties",
            "tool": "scene_get_tree",
            "args": { "include_properties": true },
            "expect": {
              "has_keys": ["result"],
              "field_checks": [
                { "key": "result.name", "value": "Root" },
                { "key": "result.type", "value": "Node" },
                { "key": "result.path", "value": "Root" },
                { "key": "result.children", "not_empty": true }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "tree_get_full",
            "tool": "scene_tree_get",
            "expect": {
              "has_keys": ["result"],
              "field_checks": [
                { "key": "result.name", "value": "Root" },
                { "key": "result.type", "not_empty": true },
                { "key": "result.path", "not_empty": true },
                { "key": "result.children", "not_empty": true }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_switch_refused",
        "steps": [
          {
            "id": "new_scene_unsaved_refused",
            "tool": "editor_new_scene",
            "args": { "name": "Second", "close_current": true },
            "expect": {
              "field_checks": [
                { "key": "error", "value": "current scene is unsaved — position: Root — expected: scene saved before close — action: call editor_save_scene first, then editor_new_scene with close_current=true" }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "scene_unchanged_after_refuse",
            "tool": "scene_get_tree",
            "expect": {
              "field_checks": [
                { "key": "result.name", "value": "Root" }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "group_ops",
        "steps": [
          {
            "id": "group_add",
            "tool": "group_add_node_to_group",
            "args": { "node_path": "Lbl", "group_name": "gsd_test_group" },
            "expect": {
              "field_checks": [
                { "key": "result", "value": "added" }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "group_has_true",
            "tool": "group_has_node_in_group",
            "args": { "node_path": "Lbl", "group_name": "gsd_test_group" },
            "expect": {
              "field_checks": [
                { "key": "result", "value": true }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "group_remove",
            "tool": "group_remove_node_from_group",
            "args": { "node_path": "Lbl", "group_name": "gsd_test_group" },
            "expect": {
              "field_checks": [
                { "key": "result", "value": "removed" }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "group_has_false",
            "tool": "group_has_node_in_group",
            "args": { "node_path": "Lbl", "group_name": "gsd_test_group" },
            "expect": {
              "field_checks": [
                { "key": "result", "value": false }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "arg_validation",
        "steps": [
          {
            "id": "delete_missing_path_param",
            "tool": "scene_node_delete",
            "args": {},
            "expect": {
              "field_checks": [
                { "key": "error", "value": "missing required parameter: path" }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
